· FATA HAS FULL AUTHORITY TO INVESTIGATE, PROSECUTE, AND TAKE LEGAL ACTION AGAINST VIOLATORS UNDER IRANIAN CYBERCRIME LAWS.
· VIOLATIONS MAY RESULT IN CRIMINAL PROSECUTION, FINES, IMPRISONMENT, OR OTHER PENALTIES AS DETERMINED BY IRANIAN COURTS.

C. INTERNATIONAL LAWS AND TREATIES, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO:

· THE COUNCIL OF EUROPE CONVENTION ON CYBERCRIME (BUDAPEST CONVENTION), WHERE APPLICABLE
· THE UNITED NATIONS CONVENTION AGAINST TRANSNATIONAL ORGANIZED CRIME
· APPLICABLE LAWS OF THE USER'S JURISDICTION REGARDING INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY, COMPUTER CRIME, AND UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS
· THE UNITED STATES COMPUTER FRAUD AND ABUSE ACT (CFAA), THE EUROPEAN UNION DIRECTIVE ON COPYRIGHT, AND OTHER RELEVANT INTERNATIONAL INSTRUMENTS

D. HACKING, PENETRATION TESTING, AND SECURITY RESEARCH LAWS:

· WHITE HAT HACKING AND ETHICAL SECURITY RESEARCH ARE ONLY PERMITTED WHEN CONDUCTED WITH EXPRESS WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION FROM ATLAS CODE TEAM OR THE LEGAL OWNER OF THE TARGET SYSTEM.
· UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS, VULNERABILITY SCANNING, EXPLOITATION, OR ANY FORM OF SECURITY TESTING AGAINST THIS SOFTWARE, ITS SERVERS, ITS USERS, OR ANY THIRD-PARTY SYSTEM IS STRICTLY FORBIDDEN.
